Subject: [PATCH 182/190] dt-bindings: display: xlnx: DT bindings for AVPG

commit 65acac3dcc093d13d54ecf55737381c4cb43eb21 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

AMD Versal Gen2 Audio / Video Pattern Generator (AVPG) is Logicore IP
designed to generate AXI4-Stream video and audio test signals. AVPG
supports a number of different video patterns, pixel formats, color
depth and pixels per clock.

Signed-off-by: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
